# Community outreach credentials
# ==============================
# Copy to `.env.marketing` and fill in. Every value here is read from the
# process environment at call time -- there is no secret store, no config file
# that holds credentials, and nothing is written to the database.
#
# NOTHING IS REQUIRED TO START. With this file empty, `gtm.scout-threads` still
# polls Hacker News, Lobsters, GitHub, dev.to, and Stack Overflow, and every
# skill downstream of it works. Each variable below buys one specific thing,
# named next to it.
#
# See docs/community-outreach.md for the full flow.

# --- Account standing -------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED before anything can be posted to Reddit or Hacker News -- the only
# two platforms the reference config declares account-age and karma minimums
# for. `gtm.outreach-guard` FAILS both checks when no profile is declared:
# unproven standing is not sufficient standing.
# Every other platform sets no minimums and needs no entry here.
# A malformed value is ignored with a warning rather than failing the run,
# which still fails both checks closed.
OUTREACH_ACCOUNT_PROFILES_JSON={"reddit":{"accountAgeDays":400,"karma":1200},"hackernews":{"accountAgeDays":900,"karma":500}}

# --- Reddit -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Buys: Reddit thread discovery. All four are required -- Reddit's script-app
# flow is a password grant, so id and secret alone cannot mint a token.
# Create at https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps (type: script).
# Reddit is prepare-only: Trevra will never post the reply, only prepare it.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
REDDIT_USERNAME=
REDDIT_PASSWORD=

# --- GitHub -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Buys: a higher search rate limit (10/min -> 30/min) AND the ability to post
# an approved reply, which is not possible without it.
# Scope: `public_repo`. https://github.com/settings/tokens
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# --- Mastodon ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Buys: Mastodon discovery (v2 search rejects unauthenticated requests) AND
# posting an approved reply.
# Create at <your instance>/settings/applications, scopes `read:search write:statuses`.
MASTODON_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# Optional. Defaults to https://mastodon.social.
MASTODON_INSTANCE_URL=

# --- Optional rate-limit headroom -------------------------------------------
# dev.to works without this; the key only raises the rate limit.
# https://dev.to/settings/extensions
DEVTO_API_KEY=

# Stack Exchange works keyless at 300 requests/day per IP; a key raises it to
# 10,000. https://stackapps.com/apps/oauth/register
STACKEXCHANGE_KEY=
